    {"claim": "True accountability requires continuous empirical telemetry, which captures the actual behavior of systems in production rather than relying on theoretical safety guarantees.", "targets": ["AN-6"]},
    {"claim": "We must shift our governance model toward strict, post-hoc liability and automated circuit breakers to ensure developers bear the full cost of their system's failures.", "targets": ["AN-6"]}
