    {"assumption": "Continuous telemetry provides a more accurate and less corruptible measure of AI risk than pre-deployment certification.", "if_wrong": "If telemetry fails to detect latent, catastrophic risks before they manifest, the cost of post-hoc liability could exceed the systemic benefit of rapid innovation."},
